* ''The re-cut's eight forks'' (house, under the operator's delegation, 2026-10-31). The cut reads left eight forks; the house talked each out two rounds against canon and a Gaia and an Elyncia story, and none survived to the operator: `daemonAuth` lands as one pure shared builder in mesh; node and browser pin one boot list; seven boot cells refuse a read before set by name; the share verdict lands one law per relation, measured before it merges; the stage-cut and the verb math take pure deciders and a pure module first; the shared stages converge on node's fuller form; the login suffix retires and custody resolves its home once at open; and a removed joiner never re-enters on an invite minted before the removal, its mechanism decided by the red. The floor stands at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/test-recut-road`>> #/the-floor, and the T items carry each settlement.

